{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1794857776072704492,"compiled_state":{"alias":"charitable-tyrannical-hydra","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"aadaf7aa6e917acd0a4448e2054efaff106911a313d6400ffd7bf270cffea7ef","event_uuid":"20e712e4-b52d-4ee8-909a-48309d6fe043","position":{"commit_sha":"2ebec5dd8f30fd6633d15c3f0fd4bcf35a09149f","position":"1794857688422460321-20e712e4-b52d-4ee8-909a-48309d6fe043"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"f4e3775c43fca02900c8dfc10e33658be0a7639d94f98880bbc8d780ab12d283","event_uuid":"83dbfb61-fc41-4746-89f6-f9bf11b5d43f","position":{"commit_sha":"1fe08e07d951e80ee595061fc6fe836143343320","position":"1794857776072704491-83dbfb61-fc41-4746-89f6-f9bf11b5d43f"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1794857688422460321,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"83dbfb61-fc41-4746-89f6-f9bf11b5d43f","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"6798-606d-37dc-46e7"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\nDiscovered from majestic-depilatory-beetle. The advisory `sweep (windows)` job runs a maintained subset held green: tests known to fail on Windows are deselected through `.github/windows-sweep-deselect/file-locks.args`. This bug owns that file: 19 tests in 15 modules, from the 5 scheduled runs at `b4e0d01b649` (2026-11-15/16).\n\nObserved signatures: deleting or replacing read-only git object files raises `WinError 5` (`test_pinned_ticket_view.py`, `test_ci_snapshot_fixture_cleanup.py`, `test_authorship_batched_ticket_map_7084.py`); removing a directory that is a process's cwd raises `WinError 32` (`test_detached_child_cwd.py`); concurrent writers onto one target lose a write with `PermissionError` (`test_unique_cache_writes.py`, `test_completion_verdict_cache.py`, `test_plan_review.py`, `test_bridge_state_atomic_write_concurrency.py`, `test_alert_store_concurrency.py`). 9 of these 19 failed in some of the 5 runs and passed in others; all 9 are concurrency tests. This is the file-lock behaviour the advisory job exists to detect, and the concurrent-writer cases are product behaviour.\n\n## Approach\n\nReproduce each first: run the module repeatedly on a Windows runner (`workflow_dispatch`) to get a deterministic failure before changing code. Then, for read-only git objects, clear the read-only bit before deleting; for concurrent replace onto one target, handle the Windows sharing violation in the product writer with a bounded retry; for the cwd case, fix the test's directory lifetime.\n\n## Scope\n\nThe failing product or test code for this class, plus `.github/windows-sweep-deselect/file-locks.args` (remove each fixed line; delete the file and its `@` reference in `.github/workflows/test.yml` once empty).\n\n## Testing\n\nPOSIX: the touched tests still pass under `make verify`. Windows: repeated `sweep (windows)` runs on main after the change pass with the removed lines no longer deselected.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] The class's root cause is recorded per signature on this ticket with the evidence that confirmed it.\n- [ ] Every line removed from `file-locks.args` names a test that passed in 3 consecutive `sweep (windows)` runs on main after the fix (run ids recorded in a comment).\n- [ ] `sweep (windows)` concludes `success` on those runs.\n","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["windows","portability"],"ticket_id":"b8dd-85be-1dbb-45b9","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Windows sweep: open handles, read-only git objects and concurrent replace raise PermissionError (19 tests)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["20e712e4-b52d-4ee8-909a-48309d6fe043","83dbfb61-fc41-4746-89f6-f9bf11b5d43f"]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794857776072704492,"uuid":"e0e7b01c-f6ed-4c9a-8cd6-7ad99c69c7a0"}